# Shell scripts must reach Android/Termux with LF endings. A CRLF shebang line
# fails as `bad interpreter: /data/data/.../bash^M`, which reads like a missing
# interpreter rather than a line-ending problem and wastes an hour every time.
# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, so the guard is
# not theoretical.
*.sh text eol=lf
